<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$DadNickname</span>!”</span> You jump as the voice calls out, quickly spinning around and seeing  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> standing there carrying a shopping bag. That explains it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fancy meeting you here, haha. Didn’t know you were planning to come to the mall today. Should have told me, I would have driven you.”</span> You greet  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>, explaining that it was more of a spontaneous decision. A bit curious and eyeing the shopping bag, you ask him what he’s doing here. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, last time I was here I saw these adorable little Owlman undies. Figured  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s been pretty good recently, so I decided to get them for him. He’s going to be so excited, you know how he gets. Don’t be surprised if he’s strutting around showing his stuff later tonight.”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> laughs, reaching into the bag. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here, check them out!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He holds out the tiny underwear, a perfect size for your little brother. They look a lot like  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s other Owlman pairs, though this one is a majority yellow and has a double-padded backside. They look cute.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Can you just imagine his cute little butt in these? Wonder if I’ll be able to sneak some pictures for the family album. Here, feel how soft they are!”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> <span style="color:Pink">grabs you by your wrists and holds your hand up to the butt of the underwear. They do feel pretty soft, but as you see some kids from your school out of the corner of your eye smirking, you quickly turn red, telling your Dad to put the underwear away.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why? It’s not like they’re yours. I was going to get you some, but they didn’t have any in your size. At least I don’t think so, what size is your underwear again?”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Like a machine built simply to embarrass you,  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> reaches towards your backside to check as you quickly leap back to keep his hands away from your underwear.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You get embarrassed too easily, haha.”</span> He laughs, ruffling your hair as you continue to blush, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I need to run to the restroom real fast. Could you hold these for me?”</span> He shoves the bag into your hand before running off, saying he’ll be right back. <span style="color:Yellow">Great, now you’re on bag duty</span>. <br>
<br>
<<linkreplace"Continue">>
    You stand there waiting for him, considering finding a place to sit down, as you inspect the contents of the bag. Outside of the new underwear for your brother,  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> seems to have purchased a variety of little nicknacks and doodads for the house. An oven mitt, a strange figurine, and some weird looking salt and pepper shakers. You have no idea how this strange collection of things caught his interest. You have just finished looking around the bag <span style="color:Yellow">when you suddenly get the feeling from before again, but it is much more intense. This time, however, you have next to no time to react before you are suddenly jumped on from behind!</span>

