:: Jackson Parental Drama 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
Sitting down at the table with  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> and two brothers, you begin to eat and listen to the idle conversation that surrounds you.  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> talking about something that happened in a recent cartoon,  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> playfully teasing and talking about school stuff,  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> happily listening and asking questions to show interest in his kids’ lives. It is all rather common and wholesome, though you can’t get what occurred at the mall out of your head and you finally turn the topic of conversation to this, <span style="color:Yellow">asking  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> what that situation at the mall was about.</span>

