<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It went normal. Just a normal meeting.”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> lies, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And she’s not my ‘crazy ex’. We just used to date, that is all. Wasn’t even for that long!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s not how mom told it.”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> replies, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What was that incident with the advent calendar, didn’t she-?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I will beat your butt right here in front of your brothers, do not test me boy!”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> <span style="color:Pink">threatens as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> gives him a teasing smirk.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You dated someone before Mommy?”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> asks curiously, sounding confused, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Was she pretty like Mommy?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, Dad, was she just as pretty as Mommy?”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> leans forward, <span style="color:Pink">asking in a teasing tone that makes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> blush.</span> <br>
